.TH PLANETS 10 "October 2026" "1.1" "Neverdark Manual"
.SH NAME
planets \- List the claimed regions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B planets
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
List every claimed region, one region header per line: its id, width, world
number, owner, and loaded module count. With no claimed regions it says so.
.PP
The list covers the whole cosmos, not just your own regions; what it shows
is public record. Authority still lives with the regions themselves: seeing
a header grants nothing.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR planet,here,release (10)
.SH AUTHOR
quirinpa <quirinpa@tty.pt>
